  "notes": "Some initial copies came with a removable hype sticker on the front sleeve and a merchandise insert.\nRound white sticker:\n\"★ [red star] includes the Hit singles\nWho's That Girl ? & Right By Your Side\nPL 70109\n..this sticker is removeable..\"\n\n[Back]\n[Cassette Logo] [url=http://www.discogs.com/release/1197573]PK 70109[/url]\nBelgique/Belgie: Distributed by RCA S.A.\nDeutschland: Vertrieb durch RCA Schallplatten Gmbh\nFrance: Distribué par RCA S.A.\nItalia: Distributed by RCA S.p.A.\nNederland: Distributed by RCA B.V.\nU.K.: Distributed by RCA Ltd.\nManufactured in W. Germany Imprimé en Allemagne\nSleeve © 1983 RCA Ltd.\n© RCA Records - Printed in W. Germany - Imprimé en Allemagne.\nDMM  ® Direct Metal Mastering ® TELDEC [logo]\n\n[Inner sleeve]\nStrings - with special thanks to Sid Sax.\nArt & Design - with thanks to Andrew Christian.\nAll songs published by RCA Music Ltd..\nRecorded & mixed on Soundcraft.\nPrinted in W. Germany. Imprimé en Allemagne.\n\n[Labels]\nStereo\n℗ 1983 RCA Ltd.\nRCA Music Ltd.\nMarketed And Distributed By RCA Limited.\nMade In Germany. Fabrique En Allemagne.\n\nMore information:\nThis first issue of the album shows on the back the second format on which it was issued: the cassette. Subsequent reissue shows the CD as third format.\n[url=http://www.discogs.com/release/95009]A slightly different issue[/url], with \"SE\" printed on back sleeve as German distribution code, exists.\n\nSimilar releases exist with minor differences:\nMastered at Sonopress, has price code D: SE and is not a reissue: [r95009]\nMastered at Sonopress, has price code D: SB and is not a reissue: [r10087526]\nMastered at Sonopress, has price code D: SB and is a reissue: [r5054603]\nMastered at Teldec, has price code D: SB and is a reissue: [r9933791]\nMastered at Teldec, has price code D: SB and is not a reissue: [r8139481] = this version\nMastered at Teldec, has price code D: SE and is not a reissue: [r11193767]\n\nThe runouts are etched; Made In Germany is stamped and sometimes hard to find.",
